         <title>Masters of PixInsight V8 Scripts v1.5.13</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.5.13 — Remove AutoCrop Views fixed: the abbreviated view
            identifier (R/G/B/L) now sticks to the saved ACR file, so it
            comes back correctly whenever the file is reopened later, not
            just in the session that created it. Saved filenames keep the
            full filter name (Red/Green/Blue/Luminance). 36 scripts
            total.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
